# `C97` / `C98` control. The base URL carries a path segment on purpose: a `/alpha` step landing on
# `/base/alpha` proves the step's path was *joined* onto the base rather than replacing it, which a
# bare-origin base could never distinguish.

env local default
  api "http://127.0.0.1:4507/base"
  api second "http://127.0.0.1:4507/second"
